# Prometheus exporter (USE_PROMEX=1), so the abandoned sidecar (last release
# 2023-02-15, Go 1.19.5) was deleted rather than waived. That retired 20
# exceptions outright: every CVE-2022-* and CVE-2023-* entry this block
# formerly carried, plus CVE-2024-24790/-34156/-45337/-45338.
#
# cadvisor is not exposed on any host port (no `ports:` mapping in
# docker-compose.monitoring.yml) — it is reachable only from Prometheus and
